<title>INDIA: Indian castor prices steady in narrow trade.</title>
<headline>Indian castor prices steady in narrow trade.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian castor prices held steady at 1,126/1,128 rupees on Friday in narrow trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said trading volumes remained thin.</p>
<p>Groundnut oil remained quiet at the improved level of 417/418 rupees per 10 kg on limited inflows of 40/50 tonnes coupled with litte ready stock.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
